      "fontSize": 20,
      "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
      "text": "Faults at port / HTTP boundary\nAccept transfer, then lose its response\nDelay / disconnect / 429 / 5xx\nDrop / duplicate / reorder notifications\nKill worker; keep bank state alive",
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Faults at port / HTTP boundary\nAccept transfer, then lose its response\nDelay / disconnect / 429 / 5xx\nDrop / duplicate / reorder notifications\nKill worker; keep bank state alive",
