      "text": "Defer Mockoon: add only if its HTTP fixture UI saves work. Defer stripe-mock until the Stripe receipts slice.\nKeep evidence separate: behavioral tests | HTTP contract checks | provider sandbox runs.\nCurrent WorldBank is a JSON outbox stub; this stateful lifecycle and recovery design still needs implementation.",
